# Links added in cleaning, where a record named something the collection holds but no
# column carried the connection. Every one says what it rests on.
#   documented   the connection is stated in one of the two records' own text
#   verify       asserted here from outside the source; check it before relying on it
#   interpretive a reading offered for testing, not a claim
# a|relationship|b|evidence|note|source|kind
#
# --- stated in the records' own text ----------------------------------------
