# --- the Taylors -----------------------------------------------------------------
200111|son of|200100|documented|John Edward Taylor II's record opens "Son of John Edward Taylor". The source keeps that in a note rather than in a relationship column, so the two records never met.||parentchild
200111|son of|200097|verify|Sophia Russell Taylor was John Edward Taylor's wife and John Edward Taylor II was born to that marriage in 1830. The source records her only as a wife, so the link is set down here rather than taken from it.||parentchild
PL-BASE-022|built on the site of|PL-PETERSFIELD|verify|The Free Trade Hall was put up in 1840 on part of the ground the crowd stood on in 1819, and rebuilt twice since. The collection holds both places but connects neither.||nearby
